# Semgrep ignore list for the tools monorepo
# See https://semgrep.dev/docs/ignoring-files-folders-code/

# --- Version control / editor ---
.git
.gitignore
.idea
.DS_Store

# --- Ruby / Rails generated & runtime ---
**/vendor
**/tmp
**/log
**/storage
**/node_modules
**/.bundle
**/coverage
**/*.lock
**/Gemfile.lock
**/.ruby-version
**/.rbenv-gemsets

# --- Data files (not code) ---
**/*.xls
**/*.xlsx
**/*.csv
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.pdf
**/*.zip
**/lib/diseases.json
**/lib/drugs.json
**/lib/drug_classes.json
**/lib/drugs_json_cleaned.json
**/lib/atc.json
**/lib/atc_complete.json
**/lib/pdf_raw_text.json
**/lib/seponering_data.json
**/lib/seponeringslisten_text.json
**/lib/stoppstart_section_mapping.json
**/lib/Antikolinerge.json
**/lib/startstop_debug.json

# --- Generated / static HTML (kept out of taint/sast scans) ---
**/public/*.html
**/lib/*.html
**/startstop.html
**/lib/template.html
**/lib/annotate.html

# --- Docs & non-code ---
**/*.md
**/docs

# --- Keep fixtures out of generic scans (re-enable per-project if needed) ---
**/spec/fixtures
**/test/fixtures
